{"severity":"error","file":"errors/cap_deserialize_1.march","start_line":20,"start_col":12,"end_line":20,"end_col":24,"message":"`Cap(IO)` cannot be serialized — a capability may only be received, never constructed.\nhint: `to_json` places no constraint on the type it produces, so it would fabricate authority from data. Receive the capability as a parameter and pass it through instead.","code":"cap_deserialize","fix":null,"labels":[],"notes":[]}
